DRM connector state for CB1.

Adds --drm-dvbridge to the DRM output. It takes the mode dolby-vision or
hdr10. The DRM output sets the connector, CRTC and plane properties of the
mode while the video plays, and sets the old values back at the end.
docs/cb1-integration.md of x86-linux-htpc describes the properties.

License: the license of mpv.
